Package: metrosp
Type: Package
Title: São Paulo Metro Passenger Demand Data
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Vinicius", "Oike",
      email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8015-9189")
    )
  )
Description: Provides access to passenger demand data for the São Paulo metro
    system, covering data from 2012 onward. Datasets include monthly passenger
    entries and transported counts by line, average weekday station entries,
    daily station entries, and spatial geometries for metro and commuter train
    lines and stations. The bundled demand datasets form a fixed snapshot for
    reproducible analyses and offline examples. Use read_metro_demand() to
    read the latest or a pinned published vintage from GitHub releases, with
    optional local caching.
